  "description": "Urban Prophet is a vibrant and dynamic duo graffiti font that combines bold street art aesthetics with a modern, playful twist. The primary typeface features smooth, rounded letters with gradient fills, giving it a bold, graffiti-inspired look that instantly grabs attention. Meanwhile, the secondary script style adds a casual, hand-drawn vibe, perfect for complementing the main font in dynamic compositions. Together, these two styles offer versatility and creativity for various design projects. The bright gradient hues of blue, purple, pink, and green enhance its youthful energy, while the white outline ensures readability against colorful, chaotic graffiti backgrounds. This font is a perfect match for urban-themed projects, giving your designs a modern street vibe.\nThe background design, splattered with multicolored graffiti patterns and strokes, enhances the font’s lively and expressive personality. Urban Prophet is ideal for logos, posters, packaging, stickers, and other projects where a fun, edgy, and artistic touch is needed. Whether you’re crafting a streetwear brand or designing a funky event flyer, Urban Prophet delivers unmatched creativity and style.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Urban Prophet is a vibrant and dynamic duo graffiti font that combines bold street art aesthetics with a modern, playful twist. The primary typeface features smooth, rounded letters with gradient fills, giving it a bold, graffiti-inspired look that instantly grabs attention. Meanwhile, the secondary script style adds a casual, hand-drawn vibe, perfect for complementing the main font in dynamic compositions. Together, these two styles offer versatility and creativity for various design projects. The bright gradient hues of blue, purple, pink, and green enhance its youthful energy, while the white outline ensures readability against colorful, chaotic graffiti backgrounds. This font is a perfect match for urban-themed projects, giving your designs a modern street vibe.</p>\n<p>The background design, splattered with multicolored graffiti patterns and strokes, enhances the font’s lively and expressive personality. Urban Prophet is ideal for logos, posters, packaging, stickers, and other projects where a fun, edgy, and artistic touch is needed. Whether you’re crafting a streetwear brand or designing a funky event flyer, Urban Prophet delivers unmatched creativity and style.</p>",
